     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mirt-package/CADoPN9EWqzE5vDKRYjWhDkNjrZH4aY3jfJWjHavTgowSOgz%3DUA%40mail.gmail.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mirt-package/CADoPN9EWqzE5vDKRYjWhDkNjrZH4aY3jfJWjHavTgowSOgz%253DUA%2540mail.gmail.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481381915000&amp;usg=AOvVaw22ROCvP0qkqoHDTjTeyHIp\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mirt-package/CADoPN9EWqzE5vDKRYjWhDkNjrZH4aY3jfJWjHavTgowSOgz%3DUA%40mail.gmail.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
